<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερᾰτ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>portentous,
			prodigious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				364
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφία τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; also of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. εἰς σοφίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					296e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τερατῶδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1453b9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀναπλασμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Metrod.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					831.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.206c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>monstrous</i>, of strange births (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				772a36
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ζῴδια</span>, viz. Pisces,
			Cancer, Scorpio, Capricorn, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.166
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ωδεστάτη ὄψις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.99
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				38
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ φύσιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				496b18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.26
			</span></i>.</div>
